  m_Name: IsfRanger
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: ISF Ranger
  role: 3
  description: 'A lone marksman who picks off key enemies from up to 50 m. At 150% accuracy every shot hits, with a 50% chance to crit, and you choose exactly which enemy soldier to shoot: ideal for removing sergeants and officers. Or swap the Sniper Rifle for an Anti-Materiel Rifle (10 damage that ignores armor, but without the +50% aim) or a Shotgun (10 damage up close, out to 10 m, and it can fire after moving). The Anti-Materiel Rifle can''t fire after moving, and with 5 health and only light armor the Ranger must stay out of sight, though its Chromashift Textiles give anyone aiming at it -25% accuracy; moving 15 m, they can reposition quickly between shots. A Specialist and a Solo unit: one per army.'
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 50a0166a66c96524e927414f24bc263d, type: 2}
